{"seq":2,"slug":"consistent-hashing","title":"一致性哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/caching-systems-design/distributed/consistent-hashing","wordCount":1582,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"一致性哈希\">一致性哈希</h1><p><a href=\"distributed-cache\">分布式缓存架构</a> 指出，哈希取模分片的死穴是「节点一变，几乎全量 key 重新洗牌」，扩缩容等于自制雪崩。一致性哈希是化解这一死穴的经典算法：它让节点的增减只影响相邻的一小撮 key，把数据迁移量从「接近全量」压到「约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>」。这个 1997 年由 Karger 等人为分布式缓存提出的算法，至今仍是分布式系统的基石，被每一家大厂用于缓存、负载均衡、数据库分片。本文讲清它的环模型、虚拟节点修正，以及它的两个现代替代品。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一致性哈希的核心想法：不要把 key 直接映射到「节点编号」（那样节点数一变全乱），而是把节点和 key 都映射到同一个固定的哈希环（hash ring）上，key 归属于环上顺时针方向遇到的第一个节点。环的大小固定（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{32}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），不随节点数变化——这就是它稳定的根源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[key 和 节点 都 hash 到同一个环 0~2^32] --&gt; B[key 顺时针找到的第一个节点 即其归属]&#10;  B --&gt; C[新增节点 N]&#10;  C --&gt; D[只有 N 与前驱节点之间的 key 迁移到 N]&#10;  B --&gt; E[删除节点 M]&#10;  E --&gt; F[只有原属 M 的 key 迁到 M 的后继节点]&#10;  D --&gt; G[迁移量约 1/节点数]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[key 和 节点 都 hash 到同一个环 0~2^32] --&gt; B[key 顺时针找到的第一个节点 即其归属]\n  B --&gt; C[新增节点 N]\n  C --&gt; D[只有 N 与前驱节点之间的 key 迁移到 N]\n  B --&gt; E[删除节点 M]\n  E --&gt; F[只有原属 M 的 key 迁到 M 的后继节点]\n  D --&gt; G[迁移量约 1/节点数]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希环</td>\n<td>固定大小的环形哈希空间（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 2^{32})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点位置</td>\n<td>对节点标识哈希，落到环上某点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>key 归属</td>\n<td>从 key 的哈希点顺时针找到的第一个节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增删影响</td>\n<td>只波及该节点与其相邻节点间的 key</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"环模型-为什么只迁移-1-n\">环模型：为什么只迁移 1/N</h2><p>把节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A, B, C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 哈希到环上三个点，环被分成三段弧，每段弧上的 key 归属该弧末端（顺时针）的节点。现在新增节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，它落在某段弧（比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 之间）。<strong>只有原本归属 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、且落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 之间那一小段的 key 会迁移到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></strong>，其余所有 key 纹丝不动。删除节点同理：被删节点的 key 全部顺移给它的后继节点，其它分段不受影响。</p>\n<p>对比 <a href=\"distributed-cache\">分布式缓存架构</a> 里取模的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/(N+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 迁移比例，一致性哈希在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个节点中增删一个时，期望迁移比例只有：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>迁移比例</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{迁移比例} \\approx \\frac{1}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">迁移比例</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>10 个节点扩到 11 个，约只迁移 1/10 的 key，其余 90% 的缓存仍然有效。这就把「扩容即雪崩」变成了「扩容只轻微抖动」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"虚拟节点-解决数据倾斜\">虚拟节点：解决数据倾斜</h2><p>朴素一致性哈希有个现实缺陷：节点在环上的位置由哈希决定，分布往往不均匀，导致有的节点管了一大段弧、有的只管一小段——<strong>数据倾斜（load imbalance）</strong>。更糟的是，一个节点宕机，它的全部负载会整段压给它的后继单个节点，可能把后继也压垮，引发连锁。</p>\n<p>解决办法是<strong>虚拟节点（virtual node / vnode）</strong>：每个物理节点不在环上放一个点，而是放成百上千个「虚拟分身」，均匀散布在环上。这样每个物理节点管理的是「许多小弧的并集」，分布更均匀；某物理节点宕机时，它的虚拟分身遍布全环，负载被均摊给所有其它节点，而非压垮单一后继。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[物理节点 A] --&gt; B[A#1 A#2 ... A#160 散布全环]&#10;  C[物理节点 B] --&gt; D[B#1 B#2 ... B#160 散布全环]&#10;  E[物理节点 C] --&gt; F[C#1 C#2 ... C#160 散布全环]&#10;  B --&gt; G[每节点管理众多小弧 分布均匀]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[某物理节点宕机&lt;br/&gt;负载均摊给其余所有节点]\">flowchart TD\n  A[物理节点 A] --&gt; B[A#1 A#2 ... A#160 散布全环]\n  C[物理节点 B] --&gt; D[B#1 B#2 ... B#160 散布全环]\n  E[物理节点 C] --&gt; F[C#1 C#2 ... C#160 散布全环]\n  B --&gt; G[每节点管理众多小弧 分布均匀]\n  D --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[某物理节点宕机&lt;br/&gt;负载均摊给其余所有节点]</pre><p>虚拟节点数是个权衡参数：越多越均匀，但环上点越多、查找与内存开销越大。工业实现常取每物理节点 100–200 个虚拟节点。还有「带界负载（bounded loads）」的改进，给每个节点设负载上限，超限则顺延到下一个，进一步防止热点倾斜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代替代-jump-hash-与-rendezvous\">现代替代：Jump Hash 与 Rendezvous</h2><p>一致性哈希环虽经典，但要维护环这一数据结构、查找是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（需在排序的环上二分）。2026 年的工程实践里有两个更轻的替代，各有适用场景。</p>\n<p><strong>Jump Consistent Hash</strong>（Google 2014 提出）：用一个纯数学函数直接算出 key 归属的节点序号，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 时间、零额外内存、无需维护环。它在大集群里极高效，但有个限制——只支持节点编号连续的「按序增删尾部节点」，不能任意删除中间节点，适合节点身份规整的场景（如分片数据库）。</p>\n<p><strong>Rendezvous（HRW，Highest Random Weight）哈希</strong>：对每个 key，计算它与每个节点组合的哈希 <code>hash(key + node_id)</code>，选得分最高的节点。它无需维护任何数据结构、天生负载均衡、增删节点只影响该节点相关的 key，非常适合小集群和 CDN 边缘路由。代价是查找 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（要遍历所有节点算分），节点多了就慢——所以小集群（几十个节点内）首选它，大集群（上百节点）仍用环。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>查找复杂度</th>\n<th>需维护结构</th>\n<th>均衡性</th>\n<th>最佳场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>环 + 虚拟节点</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是（环）</td>\n<td>需虚拟节点</td>\n<td>通用、大集群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jump Hash</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>天生均衡</td>\n<td>节点规整、大集群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rendezvous (HRW)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>天生均衡</td>\n<td>小集群、CDN 边缘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CDN 边缘路由偏爱 Rendezvous 的原因——无状态、无需同步环——会在 <a href=\"../advanced/cdn-edge-caching\">CDN 与边缘缓存</a> 再次出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性哈希的局限\">一致性哈希的局限</h2><p>一致性哈希解决的是「分布」问题，不解决「热点」问题。如果某个超级热点 key 全部流量打到它所属的单一节点，一致性哈希照样让那个节点过载——它只保证 key 均匀分布到节点，不保证流量均匀。应对单 key 热点要靠别的手段：本地多级缓存挡在前面、热点 key 加随机后缀打散到多节点、或客户端复制。这与 <a href=\"../advanced/cache-failures\">缓存穿透击穿雪崩</a> 里的「击穿」防护一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一致性哈希把节点和 key 映射到同一固定哈希环，key 归属顺时针第一个节点，使节点增删只波及相邻 key。</li>\n<li>它把取模的近全量迁移压到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，化「扩容即雪崩」为「扩容轻微抖动」。</li>\n<li>虚拟节点（每物理节点 100–200 个分身）解决数据倾斜与宕机负载压垮单一后继的问题，是工业标配。</li>\n<li>Jump Hash（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、节点规整大集群）和 Rendezvous/HRW（无状态、小集群与 CDN 边缘）是两个现代替代品。</li>\n<li>一致性哈希只解决分布、不解决单 key 热点；热点需本地缓存、加随机后缀打散或客户端复制，归入击穿防护。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"一致性哈希","id":"一致性哈希"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"环模型：为什么只迁移 1/N","id":"环模型-为什么只迁移-1-n"},{"level":2,"text":"虚拟节点：解决数据倾斜","id":"虚拟节点-解决数据倾斜"},{"level":2,"text":"现代替代：Jump Hash 与 Rendezvous","id":"现代替代-jump-hash-与-rendezvous"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性哈希的局限","id":"一致性哈希的局限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式缓存架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/caching-systems-design/distributed/distributed-cache"},"next":{"title":"Redis 与 Memcached","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/caching-systems-design/distributed/redis-memcached"}}